.TH HERMES-AGENT-WIZARD 1 "2026-05-02" "0.1.1" "Hermes Agent Wizard Manual"
.SH NAME
hermes-agent-wizard \- Interactive TUI launcher for the Hermes Agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hermes-agent-wizard
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBhermes-agent-wizard\fR is a Terminal User Interface (TUI) designed to manage and interact with a local Hermes Agent installation. It provides a dashboard for configuration status, a launcher for common actions, and a log viewer.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display verbose help information and exit.
.SH TUI CONTROLS
.TP
\fBTab\fR
Cycle through Dashboard, Launcher, and Logs tabs.
.TP
\fBUp/Down Arrows\fR
Navigate items in the Launcher menu.
.TP
\fBEnter\fR
Execute the selected action in the Launcher.
.TP
\fBq\fR
Quit the application.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.hermes/config.yaml\fR
The primary configuration file for the Hermes Agent.
.TP
\fI~/.hermes/logs/agent.log\fR
The log file monitored by the wizard.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBtirith\fR(1)
.SH AUTHOR
danindiana
